---
// A domain in two lanes: how a request reaches the domain's code, and how a release puts the code
// there. Both end at the domain function's live alias. Planned parts are dashed. Drawn with
// Starlight's colour variables so it follows the light and dark themes.
import Diagram from "./Diagram.astro";
---

<Diagram title="A domain's requests and releases" minWidth={600} maxWidth={900}>
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 900 1010"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="domain-overview-title domain-overview-desc"
  >
    <title id="domain-overview-title">A domain's requests and releases</title>
    <desc id="domain-overview-desc">
      Two lanes that meet at the domain's function. A request: the GOV.UK app reaches the
      Frontdoor, in the frontdoor account. Its CloudFront Function checks the request's structure.
      Lambda@Edge verifies the token, routes the request by the path segment after /app, and signs
      it with SigV4. The domain's API Gateway, in the domain account, checks the signature with IAM
      authorisation and invokes the domain's function at its live alias. Inside the function, the
      domain SDK routes the request, reads the caller token, validates the input and calls the
      handler; serving requests with the SDK is planned. The handler calls the gateway client,
      which invokes a gateway's live alias through the lambda endpoint, and the gateway calls its
      upstream. A release: the domain's pipeline proves its repository with GitHub's OIDC token.
      It asks the pipeline API, under /ci in the stage's shared account, to upload and release, and
      sends its bundle to the code bucket at an address the API signs. The API queues the release
      on the release queue. The release worker takes it, checks the bundle from the code bucket,
      and assumes the domain's deploy role in the domain account. As that role, it creates or
      updates the function, publishes a version and moves the live alias to it. Promotion, from one
      environment to the next, is planned.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker
        id="domain-overview-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="9"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto-start-reverse"
      >
        <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="head"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Lanes -->
    <text class="title" x="20" y="24">A request</text>
    <text class="title" x="480" y="24">A release</text>

    <!-- Callers -->
    <rect class="external" x="120" y="40" width="200" height="56" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="220" y="73">GOV.UK app</text>

    <rect class="external" x="560" y="40" width="240" height="56" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="680" y="63">The domain's pipeline</text>
    <text class="sub" x="680" y="82">GitHub's OIDC token</text>

    <!-- Frontdoor -->
    <rect class="section" x="20" y="120" width="400" height="270" rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="section-title" x="36" y="148">Frontdoor</text>
    <text class="note" x="36" y="167">frontdoor account</text>

    <rect class="box" x="70" y="190" width="300" height="56" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="220" y="214">CloudFront Function</text>
    <text class="sub" x="220" y="234">checks the request's structure</text>

    <rect class="box" x="70" y="290" width="300" height="74" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="220" y="314">Lambda@Edge</text>
    <text class="sub" x="220" y="334">verifies the token · signs with SigV4</text>
    <text class="sub" x="220" y="352">routes by <tspan class="mono">/app/&lt;domain&gt;</tspan></text>

    <!-- Shared account -->
    <rect class="section" x="480" y="120" width="400" height="350" rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="section-title" x="496" y="148">Shared account</text>
    <text class="note" x="496" y="167">one per stage</text>

    <rect class="box" x="560" y="190" width="240" height="56" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="680" y="214">Pipeline API</text>
    <text class="sub" x="680" y="234"><tspan class="mono">/ci</tspan> · checks the token</text>

    <rect class="box" x="500" y="290" width="200" height="56" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="600" y="314">Release queue</text>
    <text class="sub" x="600" y="334">one domain at a time</text>

    <rect class="box" x="740" y="290" width="130" height="56" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="805" y="314">Code bucket</text>
    <text class="sub" x="805" y="334">bundles</text>

    <rect class="box" x="500" y="390" width="200" height="56" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="600" y="414">Release worker</text>
    <text class="sub" x="600" y="434">checks the bundle</text>

    <rect class="external" x="740" y="390" width="130" height="56" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="805" y="414">Promotion</text>
    <text class="sub" x="805" y="434">planned</text>

    <!-- Domain account -->
    <rect class="section" x="20" y="500" width="860" height="426" rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="section-title" x="36" y="528">Domain account</text>

    <rect class="box" x="70" y="560" width="300" height="56" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="220" y="584">The domain's API Gateway</text>
    <text class="sub" x="220" y="604">IAM authorisation</text>

    <rect class="box" x="480" y="560" width="240" height="56" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="600" y="584">The domain's deploy role</text>
    <text class="sub" x="600" y="604">creates the function · moves <tspan class="mono">live</tspan></text>

    <rect class="box accent" x="50" y="670" width="680" height="150" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="390" y="696">The domain's function</text>
    <text class="sub" x="390" y="715">at its <tspan class="mono">live</tspan> alias</text>

    <rect class="external" x="80" y="735" width="300" height="70" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="230" y="757">Domain SDK · planned</text>
    <text class="sub" x="230" y="776">routes · reads the caller token</text>
    <text class="sub" x="230" y="793">validates input · calls the handler</text>

    <rect class="box" x="440" y="735" width="260" height="70" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="570" y="757">Gateway client</text>
    <text class="sub" x="570" y="776">called by the handler</text>
    <text class="sub" x="570" y="793">through the <tspan class="mono">lambda</tspan> endpoint</text>

    <rect class="box" x="440" y="850" width="260" height="56" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="570" y="874">A gateway</text>
    <text class="sub" x="570" y="894">at its <tspan class="mono">live</tspan> alias</text>

    <!-- Upstream -->
    <rect class="external" x="470" y="950" width="200" height="44" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="570" y="977">Its upstream</text>

    <!-- The request -->
    <line class="flow" x1="220" y1="96" x2="220" y2="188"></line>
    <line class="flow" x1="220" y1="246" x2="220" y2="288"></line>
    <line class="flow" x1="220" y1="364" x2="220" y2="558"></line>
    <text class="sub start" x="230" y="452">signed request</text>
    <line class="flow" x1="220" y1="616" x2="220" y2="668"></line>
    <text class="sub start" x="230" y="647">invokes <tspan class="mono">live</tspan></text>
    <line class="flow dashed" x1="380" y1="770" x2="438" y2="770"></line>
    <line class="flow" x1="570" y1="805" x2="570" y2="848"></line>
    <line class="flow" x1="570" y1="906" x2="570" y2="948"></line>

    <!-- The release -->
    <line class="flow" x1="680" y1="96" x2="680" y2="188"></line>
    <polyline class="flow" points="800,68 850,68 850,288"></polyline>
    <text class="sub end" x="842" y="150">signed upload</text>
    <line class="flow" x1="620" y1="246" x2="620" y2="288"></line>
    <line class="flow" x1="600" y1="346" x2="600" y2="388"></line>
    <polyline class="flow" points="740,330 720,330 720,418 702,418"></polyline>
    <line class="flow" x1="600" y1="446" x2="600" y2="558"></line>
    <text class="sub start" x="610" y="488">assumes</text>
    <line class="flow" x1="600" y1="616" x2="600" y2="668"></line>
    <text class="sub start" x="610" y="647">releases</text>
  </svg>
</Diagram>

<style>
  .flow {
    marker-end: url(#domain-overview-arrow);
  }
</style>
